0 38 481 [
[(We use [clone] to create 11 copies of the abstraction and send list messages)]
[(from a [text] object whose arguments are: instance number, amplitude, relative)]
[(duration, relative frequency and detuning frequency - click [text define] to)]
[(see this. The usage of [text] is merely cosmetical as it's less polluted than)]
[(using many messages in a message box. All the messages in [text define] are)]
